        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>WordLock Combination Luggage Padlocks</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThese locks are Travel Sentry approved, so they \r\nescape the bolt cutters when airport security needs to inspect a bag. \r\nIt's now safe to lock your luggage again with this TSA approved luggage combination padlock. Allows entry and relocking by Airport Security and no one else.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe first combination travel lock that unlocks with a word, instead of a forgettable number.\r\n</p>\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/wordlock-combination-padlocks\"><b>WordLock Padlocks</b></a>\r\n</p> -->\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Easy to change combination:</b> Setting is a snap just turn the dials to the new password. No dials to remove, no extra wheels to lose.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>4 dials for 10,000 + combinations</li>\r\n<li>Black dials with easy to read white letters</li>\r\n<li>Easy to remember combination</li>\r\n<li>Lock Body Width: 1 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 2  1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in 3 different colors\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/wordlock-luggage-padlock-colors.gif?v=1718159598\" width=\"400\" height=\"100\" boader=\"0\" alt=\"wordlock luggage padlock colors\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>*This  is  Discontinued.</b> See available <a href=\"/collections/padlock-accessories-padlocks\"><b>Padlocks</b></a></b>\r\n</p>",
